 Romus at Honor Hold wants you to kill 8 Shattered Hand Legionnaires, 4 Shattered Hand Centurions, and 4 Shattered Hand Champions.",9493},{70,"Pride of the Fel Horde","H","Shadow Hunter Ty'jin","Hellfire Peninsula","Shadow Hunter Ty'jin at Thrallmar wants you to kill 8 Shattered Hand Legionnaires, 4 Shattered Hand Centurions, and 4 Shattered Hand Champions.",9496},{70,"Tear of the Earthmother","","David Wayne","Terokkar Forest","Recover the Tear of the Earthmother from Warbringer O'mrogg and return it to David Wayne at Wayne's Refuge.",10670},{70,"The Will of the Warchief","H","Nazgrel","Hellfire Peninsula","Bring Warchief Kargath's Fist to Nazgrel in Thrallmar.",9495},{70,"Turning the Tide","A","Force Commander Danath Trollbane","Hellfire Peninsula","Bring Warchief Kargath's Fist to Force Commander Danath Trollbane in Honor Hold.",9492},{70,"Wanted: Bladefist's Seal","","Wind Trader Zhareem","Shattrath City","Wind Trader Zhareem has asked you to obtain Bladefist's Seal. Deliver it to him in Shattrath's Lower City to collect the reward.\n\nThis quest may only be completed on Heroic difficulty.",11363},{70,"Wanted: Keli'dan's Feathered Stave","","Wind Trader Zhareem","Shattrath City","Wind Trader Zhareem has asked you to obtain Keli'dan's Feathered Stave. Deliver it to him in Shattrath's Lower City to collect the reward.\n\nThis quest may only be completed on Heroic difficulty.",11362},{70,"Wanted: Nazan's Riding Crop","","Wind Trader Zhareem","Shattrath City","Wind Trader Zhareem has asked you to obtain Nazan's Riding Crop. Deliver it to him in Shattrath's Lower City to collect the reward.\n\nThis quest may only be completed on Heroic difficulty.",11354},{70,"Wanted: Shattered Hand Centurions","","Nether-Stalker Mah'duun","Shattrath City","Nether-Stalker Mah'duun has tasked you with the deaths of 4 Shattered Hand Centurions. Return to him in Shattrath's Lower City once they all lie dead in order to collect the bounty.",11364}} },
